    "body": "## Summary\n- expose `reviewedAt` in the reporter-safe `JobReportResponse`\n- show the moderation resolution time on `/my-reports` once a report reaches a terminal state\n- add regression coverage for the private history mapping\n- document the privacy boundary\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- no moderator identity, moderation note, enforcement audit or sanction outcome is exposed\n- pending reports keep `reviewedAt=null`\n- the field is available only through the authenticated reporter history endpoint\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, frontend lint/build and existing runtime/smoke checks. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
